{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>אָרוּר אַפָּם כִּי עָז וגו׳</b> — meaning: for the greater portion in them He curses, beyond the usual measure, but there remains in them the usual portion found in every person, so that they may receive reward in the World to Come for their subjugation to the service of HaShem — for were it not so, they would be stripped, in their aspect, of the felicity grasped eternally. And He saw that the remedy to cool the power of their boiling fervor is to divide them, and so on, and He said ״אֲחַלְּקֵם״ and so on."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:50:26.202896336Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}